---
description: CourDL agent rules
globs:
  - "**/*"
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow root AGENTS.md.

- Never commit cookies or `.env`
- UI does not spawn dl_coursera; only courdl-engine
- Sanitize Windows asset names in courdl_engine/paths.py
- Do not tag a release unless the owner asked
- No em dashes in UI copy
- Version lockstep: package.json, tauri.conf.json, Cargo.toml, engine pyproject, ENGINE_VERSION
